n_id":"y4a_gmc_c6h","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"限此完整段落、下列承接主語的來源內省名；未作跨篇或全域單字比對。"}],"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-041-wanggui-ws1512987","book_id":"b-liangshu-041","work_id":"w-liangshu","source_id":"s-liangshu041-ws1512987"},{"id":"c-zhoushu-041-wangbao-ws2432538:p002","text":"襃識量淵通，志懷沉靜。美風儀，善談笑，博覽史傳，尤工屬文。梁國子祭酒蕭子雲，襃之姑夫也，特善草隸。襃少以姻戚，去來其家，遂相模範。俄而名亞子雲，竝見重於世。梁武帝喜其才藝，遂以弟鄱陽王恢之女妻之。起家祕書郎，轉太子舍人，襲爵南昌縣侯。稍遷祕書丞。宣成王大器，簡文帝之冢嫡，即襃之姑子也。于時盛選僚佐，乃以襃為文學。尋遷安成郡守。及侯景渡江，建業擾亂，襃輯寧所部，見稱於時。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","voice_scope":"史臣敘事","mentions":[{"id":"c-zhoushu-041-wangbao-ws2432538:p002:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"襃","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role":"bao","interpretation_note":"依完整本傳及書信換聲/政權時間的來源角色辨識；不由全域單字、近名或同廟號自動選人。","identity_decision_id":"d-zhou041-bao"},{"id":"c-zhoushu-041-wangbao-ws2432538:p002:m0034","start":34,"end":37,"surface":"蕭子雲","kind":"person","person_id":"okz_h8f_ji3","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role":"xiaoz y","interpretation_note":"依完整本傳及書信換聲/政權時間的來源角色辨識；不由全域單字、近名或同廟號自動選人。","identity_decision_id":"d-zhou041-xiaoz y"},{"id":"c-zhoushu-041-wangbao-ws2432538:p002:m0038","start":38,"end":39,"surface":"襃","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role":"bao","interpretation_note":"依完整本傳及書信換聲/政權時間的來源角色辨識；不由全域單字、近名或同廟號自動選人。","identity_decision_id":"d-zhou041-bao"},{"id":"c-zhoushu-041-wangbao-ws2432538:p002:m0049","start":49,"end":50,"surface":"襃","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role":"bao","interpretation_note":"依完整本傳及書信換聲/政權時間的來源角色辨識；不由全域單字、近名或同廟號自動選人。","identity_decision_id":"d-zhou041-bao"},{"id":"c-zhoushu-041-wangbao-ws2432538:p002:m0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"子雲","kind":"person","person_id":"okz_h8f_ji3","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role":"xiaoz y","interpretation